# Base/headless server packages. Debian's regular tasksel screen still runs.
# Do not auto-select desktop, overwrite passwords, or suppress GUI screens.
# These additions support the agreed SSH, sudo and clock-sync baseline.
# zstd is required during base-installer's kernel/package setup and must
# be available from the CD before network APT sources are enabled.
openssh-server
sudo
systemd-timesyncd
zstd
